      "",
      "Potential ambiguity 2: public_key field in META vs INTENT",
      "Resolution: Standard by convention (cryptographic context puts in META)",
      "",
      "Potential ambiguity 3: Optional PARENT_HASH (when included, when omitted?)",
      "Resolution: Audit chain logic (always included except first message)"
